Description: Disable tests which require an upstream Git repo
 Certain tests require an upstream Git repo, which is incompatible with
 the way we've packaged the toolchain.
 .
 Since these tests assert things that don't apply to our packaged
 toolchain version, they can safely be disabled.
Author: Max Gilmour <max.gilmour@canonical.com>
Last-Update: 2025-08-19
